# AI & Data Handling Rules

## AI Role Definition

AI is:
- A background processor
- A value generator for learning reuse

AI is NOT:
- A chat partner
- A real-time assistant

## AI Execution Rules

- AI runs AFTER post creation
- AI runs ONCE per post (Phase 1)
- AI results are stored and reused

## Data Shape Enforcement

AIResult MUST contain:
- summary
- keyPoints
- studyDirection

No additional fields without PRD update.
